  "releaseNotes": "Added ReadBehaviour FixPossibleExplictTagsWithinImplicitSequence to identify explicit sequences when TS is implicit\nDicomImage.Bitmap no longer adds VOILUTSequence if it didn't exist in the original dataset\nJ2K rounding issue fixes which fix buffer sizes and downsampling\nHTJ2K rounding issue fix that was breaking down sampling\nNo longer change DecodeOptions.TargetHintSize during bitmap call, TargetHintSize is used correctly in bitmap call.\nGetRawFrame always returns the correct expected frame length (regardless of ReuseOnlyExactArraySize value)\nDicomObjects.Net.xml updated to use latest version",
